tent, and she keeps away from the whispered gossip that travels through Maple Hollow.<br><br>Until a chance encounter with Rafe.<br><br>As mysterious as he is brooding, Ruby is drawn to the woodsman, curious to find out about the stranger who lives deep within the woods.<br><br>But Rafe is hiding a secret. And with something lurking in the shadowy forest, will Ruby find that Rafe is her knight in shining armor, or something altogether more dangerous…<br><br>Big Bad Wolf is book 1 in the Maple Hollow trilogy. <br><br>Tropes:<br><br>🌙 Small Town<br><br>🌕 Fated Mates<br><br>🌖 Grumpy MMC<br><br>🌗 Spicy<br><br>🌘 Forced Proximity<br><br>🌑 Found Family<br><br>A version of this book was previously published as A Curse of Blood and Wolves. This book has been rewritten and edited again, however some character names and plot points do remain the same as the original story. <br><br>The Maple Hollow trilogy <br><br>Book 1: Big Bad Wolf<br><br>Book 2: Wild Wicked Mate<br><br>Book 3: Feral Fated Alpha (June 2027)<br><br>See why readers love Big Bad Wolf:\"Kept me up way past my bedtime… Had me crawling back for more night after night… Outrageously sexy…”—Mazey Eddings, USA Today bestselling author of Well, Actually<br><br>“Cozy, heartfelt, and full of tension that’ll leave you howling for more”––Lana Ferguson, USA Today bestselling author<br><br>“Cozy, charming, and full of yearning, Maple Hollow has such an immersive aesthetic with enough secrets and twists that had me binging it from the start…a perfectly magical, spooky season read.”—Julie Olivia, bestselling author of If It Makes You Happy<br><br>“Packed to the brim with yearning and tension… will grab you by the heart… the perfect fall romance read that will deliver any time of the year!”—Kandi Steiner, USA Today bestselling author<br><br>“Darker and edgier than [Gilmore’s] Dream Harbor romances… delivers the small-town coziness and sharp humor [her] readers love.”—Booklist<br><br>\"Dream Harbor's darker, moodier cousin.\" ★★★★★<br><br>“I loved the Little Red Riding Hood aspect… Maple Hollow will be my next obsession.” ★★★★★<br><br>“I was genuinely giddy reading this… could not put it down… the vibes are unreal…I was already a Laurie Gilmore fan but I was not prepared for this.” ★★★★★<br><br>“Had the Dream Harbor feel but mix it with Once Upon a Time and some secrets in a sleepy old town… I’m obsessed.” ★★★★★<br><br>“A dark but cozy small-town feel with unique characters… I zoomed through this.” ★★★★★","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9780008831790-harpercollinsuk-2026-08-13t08-01.jpg?w=400","author":"Laurie Gilmore","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/1879801","grade":3.6,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9780008831790","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2026-09-08T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":149146,"name":"Maple Hollow","partnumber":1,"displaypartnumber":"1"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/1879801","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/1879801","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":519653,"displayname":"Laurie Gilmore","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Laurie%20Gilmore&v=20"},{"id":374430,"displayname":"Ellie Gossage","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Ellie%20Gossage&v=20"},{"id":97766,"displayname":"Blake Richard","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Blake%20Richard&v=20"}]}},{"id":1931540,"title":"Big Bad Wolf. Eine moon kissed Romance","description":"Je dunkler der Wald, desto größer die Geheimnisse ...<br>Ruby Bellerose lebt am Rande des Waldes in einem Häuschen, das eher einem Märchen als dem modernen Leben gleicht. Ihr Liebesleben ist praktisch nicht existent, und sie hält sich fern von den Gerüchten, die in Maple Hollow die Runde machen.<br>Bis zu einer zufälligen Begegnung mit Rafe.<br>Der geheimnisvolle Waldbewohner fasziniert Ruby. Aber Rafe verbirgt ein Geheimnis. Und während etwas im schattigen Wald lauert, wird Ruby herausfinden, ob Rafe wirklich der ist, der er zu sein scheint ...","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9783745706147-bookwire-2026-11-09t09-02.jpg?w=400","author":"Laurie Gilmore","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/1931540","grade":0.0,"language":"German","audiobookisbn":null,"ebookisbn":null,"published":"2026-12-22T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged","upcomingaudiobook"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":176320,"name":"Maple Hollow","partnumber":1,"displaypartnumber":"1"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/1931540","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/1931540","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":519653,"displayname":"Laurie Gilmore","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Laurie%20Gilmore&v=20"},{"id":661353,"displayname":"Maja Gold","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Maja%20Gold&v=20"}]}},{"id":876301,"title":"The Wolf at the Door","description":"A former FBI agent is partnered with the enemy in this suspenseful male/male shifter romance from debut author Charlie Adhara.<br><br>Hunting for big bad wolves was never part of Agent Cooper Dayton's plan, but a werewolf attack lands him in the carefully guarded Bureau of Special Investigations. A new case comes with a new partner: ruggedly sexy werewolf Oliver Park.<br><br>Park is an agent of The Trust, a werewolf oversight organization working to ease escalating tensions with the BSI. But as far as Cooper's concerned, it's failing. As they investigate a series of mysterious deaths unlike anything they've seen, every bone in Cooper's body is suspicious of his new partner—even when Park proves himself as competent as he is utterly captivating.<br><br>When more people vanish, pressure to solve the case skyrockets. And though he'd resolved to keep things professional, Cooper's friction with Park soon erupts . . . into a physical need that can't be contained or controlled. But with a body count that's rising by the day, werewolves and humans are in equal danger. If Cooper and Park don't catch the killer soon, one—or both—of them could be the next to go.<br><br>Contains mature themes.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/imported-covers/9781515941897-tantormedia-.jpg?w=400","author":"Charlie Adhara","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/876301","grade":4.5,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9781515941897","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2019-07-16T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":77716,"name":"The Big Bad Wolf","partnumber":1,"displaypartnumber":"1"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/876301","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/876301","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":345279,"displayname":"Charlie Adhara","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Charlie%20Adhara&v=20"},{"id":352196,"displayname":"Erik Bloomquist","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Erik%20Bloomquist&v=20"}]}},{"id":876348,"title":"The Wolf at Bay","description":"Going home digs up bad memories, so it's something Bureau of Special Investigations agent Cooper Dayton tries to avoid. When he's guilted into a visit, Cooper brings along Oliver Park, his hot new werewolf partner, in the hopes the trip will help clarify their status as a couple . . . or not.<br><br>When Park's keen shifter nose uncovers a body in the yard and Cooper's father is the prime suspect, Cooper knows they're on their own. Familial involvement means no sanctioned investigation. They'll need to go rogue and solve the mystery quietly or risk seeing Cooper's dad put behind bars.<br><br>The case may be cold, but Park and Cooper's relationship heats up as they work. And yet if Cooper can't figure out what's going on between them outside of the bedroom, he'll lose someone he . . . Well, he can't quite put into words how he feels about Park. He knows one thing for sure: he's not ready to say goodbye, though with the real killer inching ever closer . . . he may not have a choice.<br><br>Contains mature themes.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/imported-covers/9781515941903-tantormedia-.jpg?w=400","author":"Charlie Adhara","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/876348","grade":4.7,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9781515941903","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2019-08-20T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":77716,"name":"The Big Bad Wolf","partnumber":2,"displaypartnumber":"2"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/876348","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/876348","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":345279,"displayname":"Charlie Adhara","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Charlie%20Adhara&v=20"},{"id":352196,"displayname":"Erik Bloomquist","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Erik%20Bloomquist&v=20"}]}},{"id":881559,"title":"Cry Wolf","description":"Agent Cooper Dayton never thought anything could be harder than solving murders. Until he had to plan a wedding.<br><br>After taking down an old adversary, Agent Cooper Dayton of the Bureau of Special Investigations has earned a break. Not that planning a wedding to his sexy shifter partner, Oliver Park, is necessarily stress free, but it's better than worrying about the ominous warning, delivered months ago, that Cooper's life is in danger.<br><br>When he's dragged to an event by his family, Cooper braces for an awkward evening, but instead finds himself in the middle of an ugly feud between Park's ex and a rebel pack leader. What was supposed to be a quick outing turns into a full-blown murder investigation after the pack leader ends up dead, Park's ex goes missing, and Cooper and Park are sent a series of disturbing wedding gifts that are somehow connected to it all.<br><br>The list of potential suspects is long, and with the bodies piling up, Cooper must turn to the one person he trusts the least: the villain he's already put behind bars once and who has nothing to lose by lying and everything to gain if Cooper is out of the picture—for good.<br><br>Contains mature themes.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/imported-covers/9781705284964-tantormedia-.jpg?w=400","author":"Charlie Adhara","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/881559","grade":4.7,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9781705284964","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2021-02-16T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":78075,"name":"Big Bad Wolf","partnumber":5,"displaypartnumber":"5"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/881559","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/881559","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":345279,"displayname":"Charlie Adhara","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Charlie%20Adhara&v=20"},{"id":352196,"displayname":"Erik Bloomquist","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Erik%20Bloomquist&v=20"}]}},{"id":275665,"title":"Big Bad Wolf","description":"Joe Peluso has blood on his hands. But lawyer and psychologist Neha Ahluwalia is determined to help him craft a solid defense...even if she can't defend her own obsession. She knows Joe took out those Russian mobsters for good reason—they were responsible for the death of his beloved foster brother. But those six bad guys were part of the ruthless clan of bear shifters who control Brooklyn's Russian mafia, so Joe’s vigilante justice has earned him countless enemies in New York's supernatural-controlled underworld and no friends in a government that now bends to Russia at every turn. Joe knows that creatures like him only deserve the worst—darkness, solitude, punishment. But meeting Neha makes him feel human for the first time in forever. He's never wanted anything in his life like he wants her, and he'll break almost any rule to spend another minute alone with her. But when the Russian mob attacks the jail for payback, Joe and Neha are forced to escape. Before long, they're on the run—from monsters who want him dead and from their own traitorous hearts.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/erimage-9781666545203-coresourcedreamscape-2022-12-21t01-00.jpg?w=400","author":"Suleikha Snyder","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/275665","grade":0.0,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9781666545203","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2021-03-15T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":14461,"name":"Third Shift","partnumber":1,"displaypartnumber":"1"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/275665","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/275665","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":100898,"displayname":"Suleikha Snyder","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Suleikha%20Snyder&v=20"},{"id":113105,"displayname":"Shiloh Gray","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Shiloh%20Gray&v=20"}]}},{"id":876297,"title":"Thrown to the Wolves","description":"Agent Cooper Dayton is going to meet his boyfriend's werewolf family. Unarmed. On their turf.<br><br>And he's bringing his cat.<br><br>When Agent Cooper Dayton agreed to attend the funeral for Oliver Park's grandfather, he didn't know what he was getting into. Turns out, the deceased was the alpha of the most powerful werewolf pack on the eastern seaboard. And his death is highly suspicious. Regardless, Cooper is determined to love and support Park the way Park has been there for him.<br><br>But Park left him woefully unprepared for the wolf pack politics and etiquette. Rival packs? A seating order at the dinner table? A mysterious figure named the Shepherd? The worst is that Park didn't tell his family one key thing about Cooper. Cooper feels two steps behind, and reticent Park is no help.<br><br>There are plenty of pack members eager to open up about Park and why Cooper is wrong for him. Their stories make Cooper wonder if he's holding Park back. But there's no time to get into it . . . as lethal tranquilizer darts start to fly, Cooper needs to solve the mystery of the alpha's death and fight for the man he loves—all before someone else dies.<br><br>Contains mature themes.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/imported-covers/9781515941910-tantormedia-.jpg?w=400","author":"Charlie Adhara","shareurl":"http