be scared of him, they just keep meddling with his plans – the troll under the bridge, the three annoying pigs, and that pesky Little Red Riding Hood! This is going to take all his brain power and his most cunning smile, to catch Grandma and reclaim his place at the top of the food chain!<br><br>Come down to the Fairytale Woods and discover what your favourite characters are really thinking in the bestselling series from Ben Miller, illustrated by Elisa Paganelli.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9781398530386-simonschuster-2024-01-19t03-20.jpg?w=400","author":"Ben Miller","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/1188080","grade":0.0,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9781398530386","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2024-03-14T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":112511,"name":"Fairytale Woods","partnumber":1,"displaypartnumber":"1"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/1188080","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/1188080","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":46007,"displayname":"Ben Miller","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Ben%20Miller&v=20"}]}},{"id":1566902,"title":"The Big Bad Wolf","description":"Jake and Willow return to the fairy-tale realm of Grimmworld to look for their missing father, only to find themselves battling the Big Bad Wolf in a world on the brink of war. <br><br> Willow and Jake have done the impossible and brought the first “happily ever after” to Grimmworld. But in the real world, their father is still missing, and the boundary between universes has grown even more fragile. <br><br> Determined to reunite their fractured family, the twins return to Grimmworld, only to be captured by fairies and forced to make an impossible choice: Steal the Wolf King’s gold claw and return it to the fairy queen in exchange for information about their father, or refuse and become the fairies’ eternal, soulless slaves. <br><br> But to steal the claw, Jake and Willow will have to undergo the Wolf Trials, a perilous series of tests and traps that will push the twins to their limits and beyond. It will take Willow’s strength, Jake’s intellect, and the love and friendship they share—and maybe a few treats from Red Riding Hood’s magical basket—to defeat the Big Bad Wolf, find the next clue to their father’s whereabouts, and perhaps even bring another “happily ever after” to Grimmworld. ","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/erimage-9781666693492-coresourcedreamscape-2025-01-29t17-09.jpg?w=400","author":"Michaelbrent Collings","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/1566902","grade":0.0,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9781666693492","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2025-03-11T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":115104,"name":"Grimmworld","partnumber":2,"displaypartnumber":"2"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/1566902","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/1566902","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":381978,"displayname":"Michaelbrent Collings","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Michaelbrent%20Collings&v=20"},{"id":682440,"displayname":"Luone Ingram","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Luone%20Ingram&v=20"}]}},{"id":887232,"title":"The Big Bad Wolf","description":"Kensey Deaton comes from an elite werewolf lineage, but just because her family is royalty, doesn't mean she'll fall in line like some perfect little princess. She has plans and they don't include an arranged marriage!<br><br>Slade McAlister has his own family drama. His Alpha father happens to be the most reviled wolf on the eastern seaboard, and it's a stigma he can't escape. So when his neighbor Kensey—the girl of his dreams and his nightmares—proposes a solution to solve both of their problems, he sees an opportunity he can't ignore.<br><br>Kensey and Slade aren't only from opposite sides of the tracks, they're from opposite sides of the war. But if they can sell their \"relationship,\" they might just make it out of this with their freedom.<br><br>A<br><br>You know, as long as all that fake PDA doesn't turn into more . . .","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/imported-covers/9798765036044-tantormedia-.jpg?w=400","author":"Jus Accardo","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/887232","grade":0.0,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9798765036044","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2022-11-29T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/887232","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/887232","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":367575,"displayname":"Jus Accardo","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Jus%20Accardo&v=20"},{"id":103550,"displayname":"Shaina Summerville","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Shaina%20Summerville&v=20"},{"id":365261,"displayname":"TJ Clark","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=TJ%20Clark&v=20"}]}},{"id":1779564,"title":"The Big Bad Wolf Murder","description":"THE BIG BAD WOLF IS DEAD!<br>And what's worse, he was murdered! Alarick was a sporting superstar, top wolf in the Tooth & Claw games, and his death in the middle of the championship game against the Reds is a huge scandal.<br>When his rival Ruby of the Reds realizes she has been framed for the crime, she goes on the run, determined to clear her name. But with a dogged detective and a wolf assassin on her tail, she's going to need more than a little help from her new wolf-cub friend Fillan. Only her Tooth & Claw skills will help her evade capture and nail the real murderer.<br>A super-pacy fairy-tale crime romp, from the bestselling author of The Train to Impossible Places, for fans of Murder Most Unladylike and twisted fairy tales like Disney's Descendants.<br>\"Perfect for any young readers who enjoy a spot of cosy crime.\" The Sunday Express on P.G. Bell's The Beanstalk Murder","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9781004221332-wfhowes-2025-11-28t13-16.jpg?w=400","author":"P.G. Bell","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/1779564","grade":0.0,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9781004221332","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2026-01-20T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/1779564","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/1779564","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":364503,"displayname":"P.G. Bell","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=P.G.%20Bell&v=20"},{"id":254097,"displayname":"Josie Charles","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Josie%20Charles&v=20"}]}},{"id":1939550,"title":"Big Bad Wolf Games","description":"Die »Fangzahn-und-Klauen-Spiele« sind ein legendärer Wettkampf, bei dem Wölfe gegen Menschen antreten. Kurz bevor Ruby Red den Sieg für ihre Mannschaft holt, fällt Alarick, der berühmteste und böseste Wolf, plötzlich tot um! Und Ruby soll die Schuldige sein. Mit dem Wolfsjungen Fillan flieht sie in einer rasanten Verfolgunsjagd. Doch mit einem hartnäckigen Detektiv und einer Gangster-Oma auf den Fersen, brauchen sie Rubys ganze Cleverness, um die Wahrheit aufzudecken.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9783407790323-bookwire-2026-04-13t10-03.jpg?w=400","author":"Unknown author","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/1939550","grade":0.0,"language":"German","audiobookisbn":null,"ebookisbn":"9783407790323","published":"2026-03-19T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/1939550","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/1939550","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[]}},{"id":2060253,"title":"BBW: Big Bad Wolf","description":"A centaur has entered a new land.<br>Orion Leventis comes from a strong lineage that is connected to another strong lineage. History has proven that having a centaur in the pack makes it elite. Ask the Louries. The only thing this centaur is missing is a mate. When Orion joins a pack for the first time, will he be able to integrate the woman that he loves in the mix, or will there be a Big Bad Wolf to take her place?<br>Find out how it feels for a fearless centaur to meet a big, bad wolf.","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9798347032112-podiumbookwire-2026-08-11t20-43.jpg?w=400","author":"Mel Dau","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/2060253","grade":0.0,"language":"English","audiobookisbn":"9798347032112","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/2060253","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/2060253","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":582868,"displayname":"Mel Dau","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Mel%20Dau&v=20"},{"id":365328,"displayname":"Midnite Michael","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Midnite%20Michael&v=20"},{"id":349309,"displayname":"Anna Lynn Wright","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Anna%20Lynn%20Wright&v=20"}]}},{"id":2067120,"title":"Big Bad Wolf","description":"Welkom in Maple Hollow: je nieuwste romance-obsessie! Big Bad Wolf van internationaal bestsellerauteur Laurie Gilmore is de start van een small town romanceserie met een weerwolven-twist.<br>Ruby Bellerose woont aan de rand van het bos, in een charmant huisje dat uit een sprookje lijkt te komen. Haar liefdesleven staat op pauze en ze houdt zich afzijdig van het gefluister dat door het kleine stadje Maple Hollow rondgaat. Totdat ze onverwachts Rafe ontmoet.<br><br>Deze zwijgzame, intrigerende man draagt een verleden met zich mee dat net zo mysterieus is als de blik in zijn donkere ogen. Terwijl er iets rond lijkt te waren tussen de schaduwen van het woud, vraagt Ruby zich af: is hij haar ridder op het witte paard, of eerder een wolf in schaapskleren?<br>'Even knus als sfeervol: Big Bad Wolf is een heerlijke mix van small town romance, bovennatuurlijke magie en spanning om bij weg te zwijmelen. Een absolute must-read voor dit najaar. Dit is zo'n verhaal dat je doet howlen naar het volgende deel!' Elena Armas, New York Times-bestsellerauteur van De Spaanse liefdesleugen<br>'Wonderbaarlijk en betoverend! Big Bad Wolf is een knusse, charmante en spicy ontsnapping, boordevol verlangen en zinderende spanning. Gilmore schrijft warm en herkenbaar, en deze personages veroveren je hart om het vervolgens niet meer los te laten. De perfecte herfstromance waar je eigenlijk het hele jaar door van kunt genieten!' Kandi Steiner, USA Today-bestsellerauteur<br>'Met Big Bad Wolf bewijst Laurie Gilmore opnieuw dat ze simpelweg de beste is in wat ze doet.' Julie Olivia, bestsellerauteur van If It Makes You Happy<br>'Laurie Gilmores bijzonder sexy versie van Roodkapje is wat donkerder en scherper dan haar Dream Harbor-romances, maar heeft nog altijd die knusse small town sfeer en gevatte humor waar haar lezers zo van houden.' Booklist<br>'Fans van Gilmore zullen hier volop van genieten.' Publishers Weekly","image":"https://prod-bb-images.akamaized.net/book-covers/coverimage-9789402778731-cbbookwire-2026-08-22t02-09.jpg?w=400","author":"Laurie Gilmore","shareurl":"https://www.bookbeat.com/de/book/2067120","grade":3.5,"language":"Dutch","audiobookisbn":"9789402778731","ebookisbn":null,"published":"2026-09-11T00:00:00+00:00","contenttypetags":["unabridged"],"audiobooksinglesale":null,"ebooksinglesale":null,"series":{"id":171823,"name":"Maple Hollow","partnumber":1,"displaypartnumber":"1"},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://edge.bookbeat.com/api/books/49/2067120","method":"GET"},"nextcontent":{"href":"https://api.bookbeat.com/api/nextcontentviews/2067120","method":"GET"}},"topbadges":[],"_embedded":{"contributors":[{"id":519653,"displayname":"Laurie Gilmore","role":"bb-author","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch/books?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&author=Laurie%20Gilmore&v=20"},{"id":1061261,"displayname":"Yara Veenstra","role":"bb-narrator","booksurl":"https://search-api.bookbeat.com/api/appsearch?query=*&offset=0&limit=50&market=49&narrator=Yara%20Veenstra&v=20"}]}}],"authors":[{"id":345279,"name":"Charlie Adhara"},{"id":519653,"name":"Laurie Gilmore"},{"id":100898,"name":"Suleikha Snyder"},{"